+    final_state_inplace (SGLANG_INFX_STATE_INPLACE, r1-c8 it9; default False = recipe): the state after the last
+    verify token (step L - 1) is stored into the request's committed mamba slot (the slot the recurrence read, same
+    thread, same elements) instead of intermediate_ssm[row][L - 1]: a request that accepts all L tokens then needs no
+    commit copy, and a partial accept overwrites the slot from intermediate_ssm[row][step < L - 1]
+    (scatter_mamba_states_after_mtp_verify, final_step_inplace); ple_ist_row: bf16 elements per request row of the PLE intermediate
+    short-conv state; ictx_row: int64 elements per request row of the n-gram intermediate context. The pointer
