+    # SGLANG_INFX_MONO_ATTN_TASKS (r1-c4 it14): QSA attention tail-first task order, b128 K LDS stores, V^T XOR
+    # swizzle and the head-pair qsa_merge. False = recipe code. A closure scalar, so it enters the FlyDSL cache key.
+    ATT_TF = bool(_infx_knobs.MONO_ATTN_TASKS)
+    # SGLANG_INFX_ROUTER_TAIL (r2-c1 it12): the router GEMV tiles run on CTAs [G - ROUTER_RG, G) (no HC mix down/up
+    # task there, so they issue the router weights while the mix runs) instead of [0, ROUTER_RG) (HC up producers,
+    # which issue them only after their up task). Tile rg = bid - RT0: same per-tile math (bitwise). 0 = recipe.
+    # A closure scalar, so it enters the FlyDSL kernel cache key.
