+    # SGLANG_INFX_MONO_HOIST (r2-c2 it10; default OFF here, r2-c2 had it default on): per-row weight / scale loads issued at stage start or with the
+    # tile's weights instead of after the barrier that precedes their use (same values, bitwise). Closure scalar, so
