+    # SGLANG_INFX_MONO_PREWAIT (r2-c2 it11/it25; default OFF here, r2-c2 had it default on): the HC mix up phase first spins on one mailbox word per
+    # down producer (the last-written entry of each (K-slice, row group)) and only then issues its full poll of the
+    # T x 320 x 10 down partials, instead of re-reading the whole ~T x 25 KB partial set on every spin. The full poll
