+                              (seed column copy, mrope +1, MTP monokernel step bump, positions
+                              restore) into the topk1 finalize kernel; drafter logits stay bf16
+                              (the split argmax compares in fp32 either way); draft-extend argmax
+                              without the scratch-positions zeros (bitwise)
